Everything in this block is invisible semantic direction, never visible text. Do not render, quote, label, or paraphrase any wording from it: 靠近热源时，外侧鞋面会优先升温、优先变干；但鞋头深部、鞋垫下方及内衬与中底之间的区域，仍可能保留较高湿度。表面已经干燥，并不代表整双鞋的含水量已降到适合穿着的水平。. The reader block is: 外层鞋面可以先干，而鞋头深部、鞋垫下方和内衬与中底之间仍可能潮湿，因此外干不等于整鞋干透。. Preserve this source relationship: 同一只鞋的外层与三个深层位置处于不同干湿状态。. Make the source relationship legible through this visual solution: 一只近乎二维的侧向剖面运动鞋作为唯一主对象：外层鞋面留白且无水滴；鞋头深处、鞋垫下方、内衬与中底之间各有稀疏水滴；三个小而不等大的关联局部围绕主鞋错位排布，使用细灰引线而非第二只鞋。. Show: 外层鞋面干爽且没有水滴; 鞋头深部、鞋垫下方和内衬与中底之间仍各有水滴; 三处深层水分都属于同一只鞋的内部. The title and subtitle may orient the reader but never prove this relationship; its proof must remain in the content stage. Explicitly do not imply: 第二只鞋; 鞋内已经干透; 水分回流.

Scene integrity is non-negotiable: Depict exactly 1 complete embodied subject(s). Continuity rules: 鞋面、内衬、中底、鞋垫、鞋舌和鞋底构成同一只连续鞋; 剖面只揭示局部内部结构; 所有水滴附着于同一鞋的指定区域. Never depict: 第二只鞋; 分离鞋底; 断裂鞋舌; 热源设备..

Use comparison as the one dominant visual grammar, never a second grammar. Its required topology is: Make two or more source-supported alternatives visibly different even when labels are hidden; at least one difference must be object, position, connection, sequence, or boundary.. It must visibly prove: two or more alternatives; visible structural difference. Generic symbols, anonymous nodes, or arrows alone do not prove the source relationship: every non-self-evident source step or term must be identified by the exact short label or note declared in this page's annotation plan. Do not substitute: single-process diagram; name-only comparison; generic chart.

Make this selected grammar visibly provable in the finished image through these reader-visible facts: 外层与三处深层在同一只鞋中呈现相反的干湿状态; 三处深层水滴的位置可分别辨认为鞋头、鞋垫下方和内衬与中底之间. Each proof must be visible in the content stage itself, not supplied only by the title or subtitle. Do not let one generic illustrative scene substitute for this evidence.

Make these source-supported comparison differences visibly distinct in objects, positions, connections, sequence, or boundaries: 同一只鞋的外层无水滴而深层有水滴; 三处深层位置通过引线附着于同一只鞋.

Apply only this page's declared information encoding:
- label targets 无水滴的外层鞋面; render exactly "外层已干"; source support: 外侧鞋面会优先升温、优先变干
- label targets 三个内部水滴区域; render exactly "深层残湿"; source support: 鞋头深部、鞋垫下方及内衬与中底之间的区域，仍可能保留较高湿度
Its visual language is: Use quiet thin gray leaders and labels; one declared green relation line may be used. Render only the exact visible label or note content declared by the page plan. Annotations are subordinate to the relationship and never decorative. Do not add any annotation not declared here.

Create a single explanatory body image. Render exactly once in the pure-white upper title region: 外干，不等于整鞋干. Use the core-title role: high-contrast Songti-like editorial serif, semibold, #1A6B3A, at most 1 line, center aligned around the title-region center at x=600; never left or right align it. Render exactly once directly below it: 真正的湿气藏在深层位置. Use the subtitle role: regular, #6B6B6B, at most 1 line, center aligned around that same center; never left or right align it. Treat the two lines as one centered text block. Keep this title region free of artwork, frame, and divider.

Keep all semantic elements inside one calm, asymmetric content cluster with 55–68% quiet space, no more than 4 semantic groups, and 0–3 supporting elements. Vary the related objects' scale, spacing, and vertical placement; do not arrange them as an even row, mirrored pair, grid, card wall, or unrelated decorative collage. The drawn cluster occupies at most 64% of the content-stage width and 62% of its height. Use a medium hero scale: do not enlarge the central object merely to make its relationship legible; do not let it fill the lower half or reach the stage edges. Keep any declared labels and explanations local and subordinate. Split the page instead of adding competing structures when the relationship cannot remain legible. Do not use edge-to-edge hero; oversized object or dashboard; card wall; unrelated scenery; logo reserve content.

